   $q$According to the passage, what problem did musicians report in the original Velloran Hall?$q$, $q$[{"text":"Players on stage struggled to hear one another, so sections fell out of time.","is_correct":true},{"text":"The wooden ceiling made the brass section sound too loud for the hall's size.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"},{"text":"The hall had too few seats to cover the cost of hiring a full orchestra.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"},{"text":"The audience in the back rows could not hear the quieter string instruments.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$Players on stage struggled to hear one another, so sections fell out of time.$q$, $q$The first paragraph says players "could not hear one another" and strings "fell slightly out of time with the brass." The passage never describes complaints from the audience in the back rows.$q$, 'draft', '993a02db-dec6-55b6-b272-bccf9f74626c')
