   $q$According to the passage, what was the purpose of the thinner seat fabric?$q$, $q$[{"text":"To make the seats more comfortable for audiences during long performances.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"},{"text":"To reflect sound back toward the stage so players could hear each other.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"confuses-detail"},{"text":"To make an empty hall sound more like a full one during rehearsals.","is_correct":true},{"text":"To absorb more sound so that amplified concerts would not seem too loud.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"confuses-detail"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$To make an empty hall sound more like a full one during rehearsals.$q$, $q$The fabric was chosen so "an empty seat absorbs about as much sound as a seated listener," which "lets rehearsals in an empty hall sound closer to concerts." Helping players hear each other was the job of the panels, not the seats.$q$, 'draft', '993a02db-dec6-55b6-b272-bccf9f74626c')
