   $q$Mr. Osei calls the kiln "the only member of the class who could not be hurried." What does this description emphasize?$q$, $q$[{"text":"The firing process takes its own time and cannot be rushed.","is_correct":true},{"text":"The kiln is a student who often arrives late to class.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"literal-reading"},{"text":"Mr. Osei wishes the kiln would heat up more quickly.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"contradicts-text"},{"text":"The other students in the class work far too slowly.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"misreads-target"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$The firing process takes its own time and cannot be rushed.$q$, $q$By treating the kiln as a classmate with its own pace, the description stresses that firing cannot be sped up, which is why Mr. Osei "refused to rush." It says nothing about the students being slow.$q$, 'draft', '26d626ff-d221-5dbe-8f99-4fd15162e07d')
