   $q$Which is the best objective summary of the passage?$q$, $q$[{"text":"Young fish seem to follow reef sounds, and damaged reefs grow quiet. Playing healthy reef recordings on damaged patches doubled young fish arrivals, but researchers say sound must be combined with other restoration efforts.","is_correct":true},{"text":"Ferreira's team played recordings of a thriving reef every night for six weeks. Other damaged patches nearby received silent speakers so the team could compare the results.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"too-narrow"},{"text":"Young fish follow reef sounds, but damaged reefs grow quiet. Researchers found that speakers repaired the coral within six weeks, so replanting is no longer needed.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"misreads-outcome"},{"text":"Young fish follow reef sounds, so Ferreira's team placed speakers on damaged reefs. This creative and moving experiment proves that people can rescue the oceans if they simply listen.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"includes-opinion"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$Young fish seem to follow reef sounds, and damaged reefs grow quiet. Playing healthy reef recordings on damaged patches doubled young fish arrivals, but researchers say sound must be combined with other restoration efforts.$q$, $q$The first choice covers the cause, the test, the result and the caution without judgment. The fourth invents a claim that speakers repaired coral, which paragraph 4 directly denies.$q$, 'draft', '13695ebd-8121-5451-b622-b5bdb0533b5f')
