   $q$According to the passage, what is Nadia's main disadvantage in the game?$q$, $q$[{"text":"She has lost a pawn and is behind in material.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"reverses-meaning"},{"text":"She has far less time on her clock than Tobias.","is_correct":true},{"text":"She has never played against a Westbrook player.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"},{"text":"She is distracted because her coach is watching.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$She has far less time on her clock than Tobias.$q$, $q$Nadia has eleven minutes while Tobias has "nearly forty," and the passage says every move "cost her time she did not have." She is actually a pawn ahead, so material is her advantage, not her problem.$q$, 'draft', '37cd2a2f-789d-5ae3-882f-1bcb1ddcd067')
