   $q$The comparison of a guess to "a pebble in a shoe" suggests that the speaker believes:$q$, $q$[{"text":"the survey is flawed because it combines too many people's reports.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"},{"text":"a single wrong mark would be easy for the scientist to find and remove.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"reverses-meaning"},{"text":"a small false number would be hidden in the total yet still cause trouble.","is_correct":true},{"text":"counting meteors is uncomfortable work that the speaker dislikes.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"literal-reading"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$a small false number would be hidden in the total yet still cause trouble.$q$, $q$A pebble is small and out of sight but still bothers the walker, just as a guess would "hide inside the total" and still distort it. "Hide" shows the error would be hard to find, not easy to remove.$q$, 'draft', '00982fa1-3251-5590-803f-299382e8b1d7')
