   $q$Which choice is the best objective summary of the passage?$q$, $q$[{"text":"Esperanza's dull project improves only because the owner does all the real work for her.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"includes-opinion"},{"text":"A heartless landlord forces a beloved laundromat to close, devastating a neighborhood.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"adds-false-detail"},{"text":"Photographing a closing laundromat, Esperanza shifts from shooting empty objects to shooting the people, after the owner points out what will remain.","is_correct":true},{"text":"Esperanza photographs an out-of-order sign taped to dryer twelve.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"too-narrow"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$Photographing a closing laundromat, Esperanza shifts from shooting empty objects to shooting the people, after the owner points out what will remain.$q$, $q$The correct choice captures the setting, the owner's advice, and Esperanza's change neutrally. No landlord appears in the passage, and "dull" is an opinion.$q$, 'draft', '7aaa60c9-4dd2-53dd-94f3-8c7341e558e5')
