  ('606485ca-00dd-5b1c-b2ad-8d83d51a0201', null, (select id from public.skills where slug = 'read-g12-theme-summary'), null, 'hard',
   $q$How do the themes of loss and continuity interact in the fourth paragraph?$q$, $q$[{"text":"The paragraph shows that the customers do not care that the laundromat is closing.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"misreads-character"},{"text":"Each scene shows people responding to the loss by carrying their bonds forward, so the ending of the place prompts acts of continuity.","is_correct":true},{"text":"The paragraph shows that loss is not real when people have new places to go.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"overstates-claim"},{"text":"The paragraph shows that Esperanza's earlier sad photographs were inaccurate.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$Each scene shows people responding to the loss by carrying their bonds forward, so the ending of the place prompts acts of continuity.$q$, $q$Trading numbers and writing index cards are responses to the closing that keep relationships alive, so loss and continuity happen together. The loss still matters, which is why people take these steps; it is not erased.$q$, 'draft', '7aaa60c9-4dd2-53dd-94f3-8c7341e558e5')
